yourmt3/ — the YourMT3+ YPTF.MoE+Multi (noPS) model's graphs, without weights: encoder.onnx,
decoder_first.onnx, decoder_next.onnx (ONNX export of the authors' PyTorch model by
tools/yourmt3/export_onnx.py; the mixture-of-experts layer rewritten for export, same results),
meta.json (its token vocabulary and instrument programs) and recipe.json. The weights are not
here: each machine downloads the authors' checkpoint from
https://huggingface.co/spaces/mimbres/YourMT3 (pinned revision and SHA-256 in recipe.json) and
rebuilds yourmt3.weights from it (app/YourMt3.cs, Build).

